### Final Thought

Start small: build a single product page with static generation, then iterate by adding cart, checkout, and admin panels. Keep the code modular, test frequently, and let the tooling (Next.js, Tailwind, Redux Toolkit) do the heavy lifting. Once you’re comfortable, you can explore advanced topics like PWA, GraphQL, or micro‑frontends.

Happy coding! 🚀
